====== US Robotics 8200 ======


{{media:us.robotics:usrobotics-usr8200-front.jpg?400|USRobotics USR8200}}

The [[http://www.usr.com/products/networking/router-product.asp?sku=USR8200|USR8200]] is a 5-port
router with USB 2.0 and Firewire ports. The internal USRobitics codename for the product is
"Jeeves". The released firmware is based on Jungo's OpenRG.

